  "introduction": "Learn angles at intersections and in polygons through explanations and practice.",
  "definition": "Adjacent angles forming a straight line sum to 180°. Vertically opposite angles formed by intersecting straight lines are equal. The interior angles of a simple n-sided polygon sum to (n−2) × 180°, because it can be divided into n−2 triangles.",
